 "name_en": "Contract Management with SAP Ariba Contracts (4AZ)",
 "description_en_html": "<!DOCTYPE html SYSTEM \"about:legacy-compat\">\n<html lang=\"en-us\">\n <head>\n  <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\">\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"copyright\" content=\"(C) Copyright 2025\">\n  <meta name=\"generator\" content=\"DITA-OT\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"commonltr.css\">\n  <title>Contract Management with SAP Ariba Contracts (4AZ)</title>\n </head>\n <body id=\"loiob4044c2759fe46ee9f4f166a3c91bd37\">\n  <main role=\"main\">\n   <article role=\"article\" aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\">\n    <div class=\"body conbody\">\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loiob4044c2759fe46ee9f4f166a3c91bd37__sol_var_overview\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Overview</h2>\n      <p class=\"p\">In \"Contract Management with SAP Ariba Contracts\", you can integrate value and quantity contracts. These are agreements for a company to order certain quantities of products during a specified period. In SAP Ariba Contracts, users can negotiate prices for goods and lean services to be procured, and they can sign a legally binding contract with a supplier. In source determination in <span class=\"ph pname\">SAP S/4HANA Cloud Private Edition</span>, contracts can then be assigned in the source list as fixed sources of supply. Pricing details are passed on from SAP Ariba Contracts to the operational system, so that operational purchasers can use these prices to buy goods or services as required. Target groups of Contract Management with SAP Ariba Contracts are purchasing managers as well as strategic buyers and operational purchasers.</p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loiob4044c2759fe46ee9f4f166a3c91bd37__key_process_flow\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Key Process Flow</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">Create contract in SAP Ariba Contracts</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Set up and review contract terms</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Approve contract</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Send contract to <span class=\"ph pname\">SAP S/4HANA Cloud Private Edition</span></li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Automatically create operational purchase contract</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Automatically approve and release operational purchase contract</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Use operational purchase contract as source of supply</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Create purchase order against operational purchase contract</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loiob4044c2759fe46ee9f4f166a3c91bd37__business_benefits\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Business Benefits</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">Manage purchase contracts for materials and lean services</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Automate and accelerate the contract lifecycle</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Standardize and control contract development</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Minimize effort for tracking and administration of contracts</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Optimize the value of contracts by supporting full-scale reporting</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Strengthen operational, contractual, and regulatory compliance</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n    </div>\n   </article>\n  </main>\n </body>\n</html>",
 "description_zh_html": "<!DOCTYPE html SYSTEM \"about:legacy-compat\">\n<html lang=\"en-us\">\n <head>\n  <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\">\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"copyright\" content=\"(C) Copyright 2025\">\n  <meta name=\"generator\" content=\"DITA-OT\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"commonltr.css\">\n  <title>使用 SAP Ariba Contracts 进行合同管理 (4AZ)</title>\n </head>\n <body id=\"loiob4044c2759fe46ee9f4f166a3c91bd37\">\n  <main role=\"main\">\n   <article role=\"article\" aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\">\n    <div class=\"body conbody\">\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loiob4044c2759fe46ee9f4f166a3c91bd37__sol_var_overview\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">概览</h2>\n      <p class=\"p\">在“使用 SAP Ariba Contracts 的合同管理”中，您可以集成价值和数量合同。这些是公司在指定期间内订购特定数量产品的协议。在 SAP Ariba Contracts 中，用户可以协商要采购的货物和精简服务的价格，并且可以与供应商签订具有法律约束力的合同。然后，在 <span class=\"ph pname\">SAP S/4HANA Cloud Private Edition</span> 的货源确定中，可以在货源清单中将合同分配为固定货源。定价详细信息从 SAP Ariba Contracts 传递到操作系统，以便操作采购员可以根据需要使用这些价格购买商品或服务。使用 SAP Ariba Contracts 进行合同管理的目标组是采购经理以及战略采购商和运营采购员。</p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loiob4044c2759fe46ee9f4f166a3c91bd37__key_process_flow\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">关键流程流</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">在 SAP Ariba Contracts 中创建合同</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">设置和审核合同条款</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">审批合同</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">将合同发送到 <span class=\"ph pname\">SAP S/4HANA Cloud Private Edition</span></li>\n       <li class=\"li\">自动创建运营采购合同</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">自动审批和审批运营采购合同</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">使用运营采购合同作为货源</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">根据运营采购合同创建采购订单</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loiob4044c2759fe46ee9f4f166a3c91bd37__business_benefits\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">业务优势</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">管理物料和精简服务的采购合同</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">自动化并加速合同生命周期</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">标准化和控制合同制定</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">最大限度地减少跟踪和管理合同的工作量</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">通过支持全面的报告，优化合同的价值</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">加强运营、合同和法规合规性</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n    </div>\n   </article>\n  </main>\n </body>\n</html>",
